Supported Mods
--------------

The SpaceCenter service supports the following mods. None of them needs to be installed, but
some functionality requires one of them, and the docs note where it does.
A property gives whether each one is installed, such as {{ see('M:SpaceCenter.FARAvailable') }}.

* `Ferram Aerospace Research`_: {{ see('T:SpaceCenter.Flight') }} works with the stock
  aerodynamics or with Ferram Aerospace Research, and reads from whichever is in use. Some
  members require it, such as {{ see('M:SpaceCenter.Flight.LiftCoefficient') }}, and
  {{ see('M:SpaceCenter.Part.Lift') }} and {{ see('M:SpaceCenter.Part.Drag') }} are not
  available with it.
* `Extended Action Groups`_ adds action groups 10 to 250 to {{ see('T:SpaceCenter.Control') }}.
* `RealFuels`_ adds ignitions, ullage and feed pressure to {{ see('T:SpaceCenter.Engine') }},
  and tank pressure and boil-off to {{ see('T:SpaceCenter.Part') }}.
* {{ see('T:SpaceCenter.Parachute') }} objects support `RealChute`_.
* {{ see('T:SpaceCenter.Fairing') }} objects support `ProceduralFairings`_.
* {{ see('T:SpaceCenter.SolarPanel') }} objects support the curved solar panels of
  `Near Future Solar`_.
* {{ see('T:SpaceCenter.Experiment') }} objects support DMagic's
  `DMModuleScienceAnimateGeneric`_.
* {{ see('M:SpaceCenter.Engine.ThrustReversed') }} supports the thrust reversers of
  `Firespitter`_ and `KerbalActuators`_.
* `KSPCommunityPartModules`_ 0.5 or later, or `kOS`_, provides the name tag in
  {{ see('M:SpaceCenter.Part.Tag') }}.
* `B9PartSwitch`_ switches a part's subtype when its field is set through
  {{ see('T:SpaceCenter.PartField') }}.
* `TweakScale Rescaled`_ parts report their scaled masses, resources, thrust, torque and cost.
* `RealAntennas`_ adds the link budget and targeting to {{ see('T:SpaceCenter.Antenna') }},
  and data rates to {{ see('T:SpaceCenter.CommLink') }}.
* The :doc:`RemoteTech service <remote-tech>` covers RemoteTech antennas.

